WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.350
The opponent lands after heavy Shoryuken.

2
00:00:00.350 --> 00:00:00.650
Ryu dashes forward during the knockdown.

3
00:00:00.650 --> 00:00:00.900
Ryu turns into Whirlwind Kick as the opponent rises.

4
00:00:00.900 --> 00:00:01.040
Whirlwind Kick connects on wake-up.

5
00:00:01.040 --> 00:00:01.060
Ryu finishes Whirlwind Kick as the opponent recoils.
